# A bare `tsc` run emits .js/.js.map throughout dist/, not just the bundles named
# above. Ignore the whole tree; `.empty` is the only file in it that is tracked.
#
# Keep this separate from the `dist/...` lines above rather than replacing them:
# `main` deliberately deletes those lines (8b12079 "allow committing of dist/ in
# main"), so editing them here conflicts on every develop->main merge.
/dist/*
!/dist/.empty
